  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of its size, design and position, would result in an overbearing impact which would result in unacceptable adverse impacts on the amenity of the neighbouring occupiers. As such the proposed development is contrary to policies L2 (Making effective use of land) and P3 (Living conditions and pollution) of the NPPF 2026, policies D3 (Optimising Site Capacity through the Design-led Approach) and D6 (Housing Quality and Standards) of the London Plan 2021, policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extension and Alterations SPD 2026.",
    "In the absence of a completed legal agreement securing on-site measures to achieve a minimum 10% Biodiversity Net Gain, the proposal fails to demonstrate that adequate BNG enhancement would be delivered. The development is therefore contrary to Policy LP47 (Biodiversity and Sites of Importance of Nature Conservation) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033, Policy G6 (Biodiversity and access to nature) of the London Plan (2021), and the National Planning Policy Framework (2026).",
    "In the absence of a tree survey and arboricultural assessment produced by a suitably qualified arboriculturalist, there is insufficient information to assess the impact of the proposal on trees within and surrounding the subject sites. The development is therefore contrary to Policy LP51 (Tree Management and Landscaping) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033, Policy G7 (Trees and woodlands) of the London Plan (2021), and the National Planning Policy Framework (2026)."
  ]
